  combinedLines: Cold winds kept blowing through the dark and ruined castle. In the
    sky, a rain of blood was falling non-stop. Dead bodies lay everywhere in the
    city. Some were children who died of hunger in their mothers' arms. | Some bodies
    were piled up under heavy rocks, while others died from exhaustion. But in that
    dark night, a 13-year-old child was trying to gather the body dust into a pile
    to burn it.
